# Synthetic device-key fixture strings used by tests and docs.
# Every entry must be an obvious placeholder. Adding a line here is the review point for the
# device-key shape check (tools/check_device_key_shapes.py): the diff of this file is what a
# reviewer looks at. Do not list anything that came from a real device.
